{
  "name": "ocapn-test-suite",
  "description": "A comprehensive compliance and interoperability test suite for the Capability Transport Protocol (CapTP) and Object Capability Network (OCapN) specifications. It facilitates the validation of core distributed object-capability primitives, including promise pipelining, third-party handoffs, and distributed garbage collection across diverse transport layers. The framework leverages the Syrup serialization format and provides modular netlayer implementations for Tor Onion services and TCP to ensure cross-implementation consistency.",
